lerTest.kt` — added 4 tests (required verification)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n- **ApiError.kt**: Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` to enum. This is the minimal addition needed to signal 409 conflict on invalid state transitions. No existing code was changed.\n- **ShipmentController.kt**: Added `confirm()` method with 24 lines of logic. Uses only existing methods and exception types. No existing logic was touched.\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt**: Added 4 tests (38 lines total) covering the 4 cases from the requirement. Tests follow existing naming, structure, and assertion patterns.\n\n**Unresolved findings:**\n\nNone. All requirements are met, all tests pass, no files outside the scope were modified.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n**Requirement**: Add `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, handles idempotent retries, rejects CANCELLED shipments with 409, and rejects non-existent shipments with 404.\n\n**Changed**:\n- `ApiError.kt` — Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` error code to support 409 response on invalid state transitions\n- `ShipmentController.kt` — Added `confirm()` endpoint that validates shipment existence, checks status, transitions CREATED→CONFIRMED, and returns idempotently on retry\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added 4 test cases: confirm CREATED, idempotent retry, reject CANCELLED (409), reject non-existent (404)\n\n**Tests**:\n- `confirms a CREATED shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED` — verifies state transition and HTTP 200 response\n- `confirm of already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds without change` — verifies idempotency (retry returns 200, no exception)\n- `confirm of CANCELLED shipment is rejected with 409` — verifies ConflictException with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS\n- `confirm of non-existent shipment is rejected with 404` — verifies ResourceNotFoundException with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\n**Verification**: `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` — **BUILD SUCCESS**, 17 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors\n\n**Not done**: Nothing. All 7 acceptance criteria are implemented and passing tests."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3151,"cache_read_input_tokens":22308,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3151},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0ba624ae-7a91-44bb-baf1-b58683d2d290","uuid":"18e2e87a-1d76-4879-b949-4d8aa58aadb6","timestamp":"2026-09-26T12:52:15.165Z","request_id":"req_011CfS5iCLwtFizt7XerJCUb"}
